WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:01.159 --> 00:00:07.099
Oh, my lady's fainted away. Some smelling
salts will set her right. I don't blame

cue-2
00:00:07.099 --> 00:00:12.219
her. Her husband's having a rough time of
it in the victory chair. I'm afraid he'll

cue-3
00:00:12.219 --> 00:00:17.920
be the one in need of assistance next.
Hmm. Seems like everyone's turned out for

cue-4
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:24.439
the procession today. Women, children, and
a fair few new interest supporters too,

cue-5
00:00:24.439 --> 00:00:29.799
come to make trouble. The old interest has
claimed both seats, but there's plenty

cue-6
00:00:29.799 --> 00:00:35.319
who don't agree. Have to say, if I could
choose, the old interest wouldn't have

cue-7
00:00:35.319 --> 00:00:41.459
been my choice either. Their campaign's
been a disgrace. And here they both are,

cue-8
00:00:41.459 --> 00:00:47.560
lining up to hit seven bells out of each
other. There's murder in the air. Are you

cue-9
00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:50.079
recovered, my lady?
